# These are separate local-only helpers (a Python/Playwright bridge and a
# Chrome extension) that the deployed Next.js app talks to over HTTP/
# extension-messaging at runtime — never imported into the app itself, so
# they don't need to be part of the deployment upload. crawler-service in
# particular can carry a multi-hundred-MB .venv and browser profile cache
# locally, which blows past Vercel's upload limits.
/crawler-service/
/extension/
